stanzas_en:
Hā re me to nirakhyā neṇā bhari Nāthane ji ho,
     janma sufal thayo māyero;
Hā re māro jhāli Harivare hāthne ji ho,
    tāṇi lidho bhav bāhero… janma sufal…
